      "## Coordination with QB-AGENT-001 (Codex)",
      "Observed 2026-10-09T17:14Z (read-only): Codex is implementing QB-AGENT-001 in the McpServer worktree `/home/sharpninja/github/cline/.worktrees/mcpserver-qbrain`, branch `qb/p1-governance-core`, base `f56dcf70` (this plan's baseline), uncommitted, 10 modified and 8 new files, all under `plugins/core/lib-node` (`src/tools/session.ts`, `src/tools/session-shim.ts`, `src/runtime/host-context.ts`, `src/runtime/core-config.ts`, `src/transport/repl-bridge.ts`, `src/discovery/marker-resolver.ts`, `src/index.ts`; new `src/cache/audit-outbox.ts`, `src/runtime/core-runtime-error.ts`). Its relayed status: not merge-ready; P1 carries most McpServer changes; P2 adds paginated session-turn listing and detail reads; six-platform REPL packaging runs through P5. Two current designs conflict with this plan: `host-context.ts` refuses a second turn while one is open (`session_failed`, \"The current turn must finish before another starts\"), and the session tool enum adds an undocumented action type `tool_execution`.",
